{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "رَبَّكُمُ", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(is) Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "the One Who"}, {"text": "خَلَقَ", "translation": "created"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "translation": "the heavens"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضَ", "translation": "and the earth"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سِتَّةِ", "translation": "six"}, {"text": "أَيَّامٍۢ", "translation": "epochs"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَوَىٰ", "translation": "He ascended"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَرْشِ", "translation": "the Throne"}, {"text": "يُغْشِى", "translation": "He covers"}, {"text": "ٱلَّيْلَ", "translation": "the night"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّهَارَ", "translation": "(with) the day"}, {"text": "يَطْلُبُهُۥ", "translation": "seeking it"}, {"text": "حَثِيثًۭا", "translation": "rapidly"}, {"text": "وَٱلشَّمْسَ", "translation": "and the sun"}, {"text": "وَٱلْقَمَرَ", "translation": "and the moon"}, {"text": "وَٱلنُّجُومَ", "translation": "and the stars "}, {"text": "مُسَخَّرَٰتٍۭ", "translation": "subjected"}, {"text": "بِأَمْرِهِۦٓ ۗ", "translation": "by His command"}, {"text": "أَلَا", "translation": "Unquestionably"}, {"text": "لَهُ", "translation": "for Him"}, {"text": "ٱلْخَلْقُ", "translation": "(is) the creation"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَمْرُ ۗ", "translation": "and the command"}, {"text": "تَبَارَكَ", "translation": "blessed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(is) Allah"}, {"text": "رَبُّ", "translation": "Lord"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ", "translation": "(of) the worlds"}], "sahih": "Indeed, your Lord is Allāh, who created the heavens and earth in six days and then established Himself above the Throne.1 He covers the night with the day, [another night] chasing it rapidly; and [He created] the sun, the moon, and the stars, subjected by His command. Unquestionably, His is the creation and the command; blessed is Allāh, Lord of the worlds."}